Z||000016||dman||04-26-2000||08:44 PM||||Visceral! Please tell me more about the picture you posted. I am very interested in that convertible. Aside from the conversion to a convertible top, it looks like the only body mods are sidescoops and the front fascia (is that a GT rear fascia and trunklid?). I went to <A HREF="http://www.fierofactory.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fierofactory.com</A>  to see if there were more pictures but I didn't even find the one you posted. Did I go to the correct site? Hmm...after looking at that picture for a while I'm starting to convince myself that I will definitely want a new front very much like that. If anyone knows an alternate manufacturer for such a fascia please let me know. I'd love to have a convertible that looked like that!<P>---- New update ----<P>I noticed that Visceral started a new thread about this front Fascia, so if you read this please post your response to the new thread since that would probably be a more appropriate place. Thanks!<p>[This message has been edited by dman (edited 04-26-2000).]||||reg||1
